<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="hosting-api" content="/api/hosting/v1"><title>Profil & Manajemen — Hosting</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#07111f;--panel:#0e1c2e;--line:#2a405a;--text:#edf5ff;--muted:#9cb0c9;--accent:#0981d1;--mint:#69e0c4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}.top{padding:18px 5%;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:28px 5%}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px)}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px}.card{padding:18px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line)}.card h2{font-size:16px}.card p{color:var(--muted)}button{min-height:44px;padding:9px 14px;background:#102a43;border:1px solid #426184;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}.status{color:var(--mint);white-space:pre-wrap;margin:18px 0}
</style></head><body><header class="top"><b>HOSTING / PROFIL</b><nav><a href="../index.reic">HOSTING</a> · <a href="../files/index.reic">FILE MANAGER</a></nav></header><main class="wrap"><p class="muted">ACCOUNT CONTROL / REIC</p><h1>Dashboard Profil</h1><p class="muted">Identitas, layanan aktif, penggunaan resource, keamanan akun, dan manajemen data Hosting.</p><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Profil akun</h2><p id="identity">Memuat profil dari backend…</p><a href="../accounts/index.reic">Pengaturan akun →</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Layanan Hosting</h2><p id="services">Data layanan akan dimuat dari API.</p><a href="../dashboard/index.reic">Dashboard layanan →</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Domain & DNS</h2><p>Domain, zona DNS, nameserver, dan SSL milik akun.</p><a href="../domains/index.reic">Kelola domain →</a></article><article class="card"><h2>File Manager</h2><p>Seluruh metadata dan berkas akun berada pada ruang tenant terpisah.</p><a href="../files/index.reic">Buka File Manager →</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Keamanan & sesi</h2><p>Kelola sesi aktif, kata sandi, dan riwayat login.</p><a href="../accounts/index.reic">Kelola keamanan →</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Tagihan & penggunaan</h2><p>Invoice, pembayaran, kuota, dan pemakaian resource.</p><a href="../billing/index.reic">Manajemen tagihan →</a></article></section><p id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="refresh">SEGARKAN DATA</button> <button id="logout">KELUAR</button></main><script src="../assets/hosting-core.js"></script><script>
(async()=>{const s=HostingREIC.readSession(),status=document.getElementById("status");if(!s?.accessToken){status.textContent="Sesi tidak ditemukan. Silakan login.";document.getElementById("identity").textContent="Belum login";return}async function load(){status.textContent="Memuat data akun…";try{const [p,svc]=await Promise.all([HostingREIC.request("/profile"),HostingREIC.request("/services/summary")]);document.getElementById("identity").textContent=p.profile?.name||p.name||"Profil aktif";document.getElementById("services").textContent=svc.summary||((svc.total??0)+" layanan terdaftar");status.textContent="Data profil dan layanan tersinkron dari backend."}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message}}document.getElementById("refresh").onclick=load;document.getElementById("logout").onclick=async()=>{try{await HostingREIC.request("/auth/logout",{method:"POST"})}catch{}HostingREIC.logout();location.href="../auth/index.reic"};await load()})();
</script></body></html>